      "released": "2021-06-17T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The series Yes, Chef! takes place in the famous and prestigious restaurant »Chateau de Philippe« in the center of Ljubljana where chef Ljubomir Bohinc called \"chef\" is in charge. He proudly rules his culinary empire which consists of many people who have to deal with his king like eccentricity. Only the restaurant manager Pika dares to stand up to him. To her men are only a distraction until a new young chef Luka arrives at the restaurant, who is yet to show his genius. Despite many complications the group morale in the ktichen stays high and when needed the group works together to solve the hardest problems",
