      "overview": "For chef Luka to be accepted in the group he has to prove his worth but not just in cooking. This time he get's trusted with managing the bar where he doesn't get by very well. Pika want's to get Luka fired therfore she fabricates a quarel between him and the waiter Miha. In the meantime the chef loses his favorite knife and decides not to cook until it is found",
