    {
      "id": "tt14760316:9:1",
      "title": "Episode 1",
      "season": 9,
      "episode": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "released": "2024-05-23T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "A new restaurant is being opened in a prestigious five-star hotel. The chef of the new kitchen is, of course, the chef, who in many ways does not agree with the hotel's administrative work. Denis wants to propose to Katja at the opening of the restaurant, but the engagement ends very unexpectedly.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt14760316/9/1/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 5367422
    },
    {
      "id": "tt14760316:9:2",
      "title": "Episode 2",
      "season": 9,
      "episode": 2,
      "number": 2,
      "released": "2024-05-30T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The news about Chef having a new restaurant in a prestigious hotel is still current. Unfortunately, Denis' slip-up, which makes him feel guilty, is also very relevant. This torments him so much that he plans to confess to Katja that he cheated on her. A \"hidden guest\" comes to the hotel.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt14760316/9/2/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 5369592
    },
    {
      "id": "tt14760316:9:3",
      "title": "Episode 3",
      "season": 9,
      "episode": 3,
      "number": 3,
      "released": "2024-06-06T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Denis is still under the impression of his dishonorable act. But he is not the only one. Even Ela, the owner of the hotel, doesn't quite know what to do with it, so she just wants to fire Denis. Will she succeed? But Denis cannot muster enough courage to confess his sin to Katja.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt14760316/9/3/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 5369593
    },
    {
      "id": "tt14760316:9:4",
      "title": "Episode 4",
      "season": 9,
      "episode": 4,
      "number": 4,
      "released": "2024-06-13T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Even Chef is in for a smile or two, which can brighten his day. Because Chef and Marjeta renew their relationship! Katja plans an erotic surprise for Denis. In a seductive scene, she is waiting for him in a luxury room, but instead of Denis, her mother unexpectedly appears there.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt14760316/9/4/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 5369594
    },
    {
      "id": "tt14760316:9:5",
      "title": "Episode 5",
      "season": 9,
      "episode": 5,
      "number": 5,
      "released": "2024-06-20T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Luka returns to Ljubljana. Somehow, he wants to know when Pika is due to give birth. Marjeta meets the owner of the hotel, Ela, who invites her and Chef to an exhibition of her paintings. Denis summons up the courage to finally confess to Katja that he has cheated on her. How will Katja react?",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt14760316/9/5/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 5369595
    },
    {
      "id": "tt14760316:9:6",
      "title": "Episode 6",
      "season": 9,
      "episode": 6,
      "number": 6,
      "released": "2024-06-27T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Pika and Luka go to the office to file divorce papers. Luka tries his best to prevent Pika from finding out who the real father of the unborn child is. Katja is depressed by Denis's confession and turns to alcohol for comfort.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt14760316/9/6/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 5369596
    },
    {
      "id": "tt14760316:9:7",
      "title": "Episode 7",
      "season": 9,
      "episode": 7,
      "number": 7,
      "released": "2024-07-04T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The chef goes to a casino where he manages to rip off a tycoon. Luka persists with Pika and even gets a job back in the kitchen. Meanwhile, Marina is jealous of Katja, which leads her to take a job in the kitchen.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt14760316/9/7/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 5369597
    },
    {
      "id": "tt14760316:9:8",
      "title": "Episode 8",
      "season": 9,
      "episode": 8,
      "number": 8,
      "released": "2024-07-11T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "An Arab sheikh comes to the hotel and everyone tries to please him. One of the Sheikh's wives puts Chef and Katja in an awkward situation. It's even worse for Miha, because the poor guy is convinced that the Sheik wants to take his Nastja into his harem.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt14760316/9/8/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 5369598
    },
    {
      "id": "tt14760316:9:9",
      "title": "Episode 9",
      "season": 9,
      "episode": 9,
      "number": 9,
      "released": "2024-07-18T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Luka is still trying to win back Pika's heart. Marjeta finds Chef's old suit and immediately realises that it is too small for him. Since he doesn't like to hear about it, Chef bets that he can lose weight in just one week. Meanwhile, Stef falls in love with Dzenisa, Chef's niece.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt14760316/9/9/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 5369599
    },
    {
      "id": "tt14760316:9:10",
      "title": "Episode 10",
      "season": 9,
      "episode": 10,
      "number": 10,
      "released": "2024-07-25T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "It promises to be a comedy of confusion as the committee that awards the hotel's stars arrives at the hotel. This is a very important thing for hotels, and now the hotel manager has drunk so much that he cannot even stand on his own two feet. To solve the awkward situation, the Chef hastily replaces him. Meanwhile, Luka and Miha are looking for a rogue hypnotist.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt14760316/9/10/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 5369600
    },
    {
      "id": "tt14760316:10:1",
