      "episode": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "released": "2024-12-05T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Luka receives an unexpected visit. His grandparents, who have no idea that Pika and Luka are getting divorced, come to visit. Meanwhile, the Chef hires a new cook with only one purpose, and that is to provoke Ela.",
